<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<font face="arial" style="font-family: arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">{!Lead.FirstName},</font><div style="font-family: arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="font-family: arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;">Thanks for visiting our website and/or downloading our e-book about out-of-area real estate investing from Biggerpockets.com.</span><br style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;"><br style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;"><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;">Now, were you just looking for education when you came across our company,&nbsp;</span><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;">or are you serious about becoming a serious investor and building a passive income portfolio and start building real wealth that will impact your future?</span><br style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;"><br style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;"><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;">Aside from publishing free content for newbie investors from time to time, our company,&nbsp;</span><font face="arial, helvetica, sans-serif"><a href="memphisinvest.com">Memphis Invest</a></font><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;">, is the largest and the most respected turnkey company in the country, currently managing 5000+ properties across Memphis, Dallas/Ft.Worth, Houston, Little Rock, and Oklahoma City.&nbsp;</span></div><div style="font-family: arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><br></div><div style="font-family: arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial, helvetica, sans-serif"><a href="http://info.memphisinvest.com/passive-investment-jumpstart-packet-content-2-0?submissionGuid=23b470dd-b486-4a46-aa03-65d089226e4c">You can see 16 short videos right here</a></font><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;">&nbsp;where our owners discuss their investment strategies and how we assist investors to achieve long term wealth.</span><br style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;"><br style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;"><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;">Attached you will find materials that will allow you to familiarize yourself with our company, our markets, the typical ROI you can expect from our offerings, property management metrics and performance data, and also answers to some of the most frequently asked questions.</span><br style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;"><br style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;"><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;">If you are serious about beginning to build your real estate portfolio,&nbsp;</span><font face="arial, helvetica, sans-serif"><a href="https://my-schedule.timetrade.com/app/td-1259187/workflows/rzlm2/schedule/availability?wfsid=16a5bde1-baba97f6-16a5be04-baba97f6-00000005-1s19g530acl5j8g9e2faj934keo7bi8u&amp;view=full&amp;fs=1">your next step is to click right here to schedule a call with me</a></font><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;">&nbsp;I'll be happy to help you figure out if we are a good fit for you as a company, and if you are a good fit for us as a client.</span><br style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;"><br style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;"><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;">Talk to you soon.</span><br style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;"><br style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;"><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;">Marq</span><br style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;"></div><div style="font-family: arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;"><br></span></div><div style="font-family: arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><br></div><div style="font-family: arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="verdana, sans-serif" color="#000000" style="font-size: 13px;"><b>------------------------</b></font></div><div style="font-family: arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="verdana, sans-serif" color="#000000" style="font-size: 13px;"><b>&nbsp;Marq Cobb</b></font></div><div style="font-family: arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="verdana, sans-serif" color="#000000" style="font-size: 13px;"><b>&nbsp;Sr. Portfolio Advisor</b></font></div><div style="font-family: arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="verdana, sans-serif" color="#000000" style="font-size: 13px;"><b>&nbsp;Memphis Invest, GP</b></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="verdana, sans-serif"><b>&nbsp;&nbsp;</b></font><br style="font-family: &quot;Salesforce Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px;"><a href="www.memphisinvest.com" style="font-family: arial;"><img src="https://ci6.googleusercontent.com/proxy/P-ZUATG-9KvjtTCYPKyMYZvbZ1icP24mB3AQG8FiodVo-sdJ2JgTowsNbAbkh7l2lFLFbGwo2IeCTAWCabhVQv1K4a8rul-WiunKnoxlWZI0uzWqL8S3lDRln2IqOfbrtqKAikZg-5guzwjsB7ufNvHZ26--Z-xThtVQ2w=s0-d-e1-ft#http://info.memphisinvest.com/hs-fs/hub/44341/file-2286025665-png/Memphis-Invest-Logo-email-footer.png" style="font-family: &quot;Salesforce Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px;"></a><br style="font-family: &quot;Salesforce Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px;"><br style="font-family: &quot;Salesforce Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px;"><a href="https://my-schedule.timetrade.com/app/td-1259187/workflows/rzlm2/schedule/availability?wfsid=16a5bde1-baba97f6-16a5be04-baba97f6-00000005-1s19g530acl5